# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment Files Architecture
#
# This project uses separate .env files for each service to follow
# best practices for secrets management. Each service loads its own
# secrets via docker-compose's env_file directive.
#
# SERVICE-SPECIFIC FILES (copy without .example and fill in secrets):
#   - .env.backend    — Backend service secrets
#   - .env.postgres   — PostgreSQL database credentials
#   - .env.weaviate   — Weaviate vector DB secrets
#
# To run the backend WITHOUT Docker (pnpm dev), use backend/.env
# instead — see backend/.env.example.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
